1
00:00:01,890 --> 00:00:06,750
Summary puts all your numbers on one screen.

2
00:00:06,850 --> 00:00:11,310
The top lists your accounts and their balances.

3
00:00:11,410 --> 00:00:15,670
Below that, your open trades added up by instrument.

4
00:00:15,770 --> 00:00:20,230
Close here closes every trade in that instrument at once.

5
00:00:20,330 --> 00:00:24,790
Bottom left, a log of everything that has happened.

6
00:00:24,890 --> 00:00:29,360
Risk Exposure shows how much you hold in each currency.

7
00:00:29,460 --> 00:00:33,720
On the right, any price alerts you have set.

8
00:00:33,820 --> 00:00:37,070
Trading takes you back.

